6. Functional Requirements
The system must satisfy the following functional requirements.

FR-01 — User Creation

The system must contain a test user named EEE User.

FR-02 — Role Creation

The system must contain the following custom roles:

bb1, bb2, bb3, and bb4.

FR-03 — Role Assignment

The test user must be assigned the required roles for each stage of testing.

FR-04 — Custom Table

The system must contain the u_institution_details table.

FR-05 — Branch Field

The table must contain a Branch choice field with ECE, EEE, and CSE values.

