Final Requirement Statement
The ServiceNow u_institution_details table shall implement role- and record-based access control using ACLs. Non-administrative users shall receive permissions according to the bb1, bb2, bb3, and bb4 roles. Read access shall additionally be restricted according to the Branch value so that the designated EEE user can access EEE records while unauthorized users cannot access protected records. Create, write, and delete operations shall be controlled independently through their respective ACLs, while administrators shall retain unrestricted access
